{"id":"vod_sn_36552","vodId":"36552","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"圣枪修女","name_cn":"圣枪修女","date":"2003-01-01","year":"2003","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/0c81d5d9c291295481c6d1c4f92d8218.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在1928年的美国，蓬勃的经济发展带来的不仅仅是更好的生活，一些肉眼无法看见的邪恶也在暗中滋生着。罗塞特（川上友子 配音）是马格达拉修道院的修女，同时，她也是一名怪物猎人。为了获得力量，罗塞特与恶魔克罗诺（石田彰 配音）结下了“怀表契约”，他通过吸食罗塞特的生命来维持自己的形象，在战斗时，更是能以生命为养料发挥出超强的战斗力。　　罗塞特明白自己命不久矣，但她有一个心结必须在死前解开，那就是她的弟弟约书亚（皆川纯子 配音）。一次意外中，约书亚和罗塞特被迫分离，而这些年来罗塞特一直都在寻找弟弟的踪迹，她能在死前与弟弟重逢吗？就在罗塞特为了亲情奔波的同时，克罗诺的内心也进行着痛苦的挣扎。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:44:08","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GLvkitvsbM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uSKhErAUcB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9TqHS68Egs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/eHx8EffHjK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LrLtmzDBj01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8b6HAByTpY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kGMiqtwnDA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VT5NPJzHwR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pR0pSDj28s1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mL109THQPe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BFKSg7SmwP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hrDNNBVk581/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vFyZzLnuWL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GKrkH47f5C1/video/index.m3u8"},{"na